{"title":"Career roadmap · Development Communication Executive","role":"Development Communication Executive","summary":"A Development Communication Executive uses communication, media, storytelling, research and community engagement to support social-development programmes. The role can involve creating campaigns, communicating programme impact, developing educational content, managing stakeholders, documenting field work and translating development issues into accessible communication.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 of UG","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Social Entrepreneurship / Development Communication"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong direct alignment. Development Communication combines social-science understanding with communication and project skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA","Development Communication / NGO Internship","Communication Assistant / Programme Associate","Development Communication Executive","Senior Communication Executive","Communication Manager","Strategic Communications Lead","Communications Director / Social Impact Communications Consultant"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build communication, development-sector and digital-media foundations"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in development communication, advocacy, CSR or social-impact storytelling"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Lead campaigns, communication strategies and multi-stakeholder programmes"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Become a strategic communications leader, development communications consultant or social-impact communications specialist"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn